      "question_html": "<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(a)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\">Write the word equation for photosynthesis.</div><span class=\"q-marks\">(1)</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(b)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\">A student increases the light intensity given to a plant. The rate of photosynthesis increases and then stays constant. Explain these results.</div><span class=\"q-marks\">(3)</span></div>",
