      "question_html": "<p>Cystic fibrosis is caused by a recessive allele (f). Two parents are both heterozygous for cystic fibrosis.</p>\n<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(a)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\">What is meant by heterozygous?</div><span class=\"q-marks\">(1)</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-part\"><span class=\"q-part__label\">(b)</span><div class=\"q-part__body\">Draw a Punnett square to find the probability that their child will have cystic fibrosis.</div><span class=\"q-marks\">(4)</span></div>",
